# The gate logs. Every round writes its release-gate output beside the tree it ran in -
# .gate-release.log, .gate-node.log, .storm-serial.log - and the numbers that matter are
# copied into the handoff under features/, which is where they belong. A log committed
# here would be a count with no commit attached to it, which tests/README.md forbids.
.gate-*.log
.storm-*.log

# A private emulator config, copied from firebase.json with another port so one emulator
# suite can run beside another job. See tests/README.md.
firebase.*.json
!firebase.json
